WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.739
Cow was busy.

2
00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:15.126
Cow was cleaning the barn.

3
00:00:15.127 --> 00:00:22.546
But no one was helping.

4
00:00:22.547 --> 00:00:27.828
Cow scrubbed the walls.

5
00:00:27.829 --> 00:00:31.495
She swept the floor.

6
00:00:31.496 --> 00:00:41.805
She washed the table.

7
00:00:41.806 --> 00:00:45.182
"Whew," said Cow.

8
00:00:45.183 --> 00:00:50.965
"That was a lot of work."

9
00:00:50.966 --> 00:00:57.936
Everyone came to see the barn.

10
00:00:57.937 --> 00:01:00.468
"Wow," said Bat.

11
00:01:00.469 --> 00:01:06.094
"It is very clean," said Cat.

12
00:01:06.095 --> 00:01:10.229
"Great job, Cow," said Dog.

13
00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:13.942
"When is the party?" asked Pig.

14
00:01:13.943 --> 00:01:19.365
"Ooh!" said Cat. "The party!"

15
00:01:19.366 --> 00:01:24.289
"We can dance," said Dog.

16
00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:28.740
"We can play games," said Bat.

17
00:01:28.741 --> 00:01:32.438
"We can eat," said Pig.

18
00:01:32.439 --> 00:01:41.616
Cow frowned.

19
00:01:41.617 --> 00:01:45.820
"You did not help me scrub," said Cow.

20
00:01:45.821 --> 00:01:48.518
"You did not help me sweep.

21
00:01:48.519 --> 00:01:53.747
You did not help me wash.

22
00:01:53.748 --> 00:02:00.741
So there will be no party!" said Cow.

